      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785418186027,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "EC2 instance we can't access from a diff zone, If we have created one EC2 instance in Mumbai, we can't\naccess it from Hyderabad, although Mumbai and Hyderabad are in the same region, that a south asia\npasific region, but they are diff zones, and data centers are eventually different.\n\n\nWE can access AWS, using GUI, CLI, or using diff diff languages using diff diff SDKs that AWS provide.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "EC2 instance we can't access from a diff zone, If we have created one EC2 instance in Mumbai, we can't\naccess it from Hyderabad, although Mumbai and Hyderabad are in the same region, that a south asia\npasific region, but they are diff zones, and data centers are eventually different.\n\n\nWE can access AWS, using GUI, CLI, or using diff diff languages using diff diff SDKs that AWS provide.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "DJjlE_su7NlH9hLd0WJWR",
